%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:291 (writeJson-writeAttributes-test)
testing: writeAttributes true - _attrs becomes @-prefixed keys
元の形: io/writeJson の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
write({"_tag": "item", "_attrs": {"id": "123"}, "name": "test"}, "application/json", {"writeAttributes": true})
%%% output application/json
"{\n  \"_tag\": \"item\",\n  \"_attrs\": {\n    \"id\": \"123\"\n  },\n  \"name\": \"test\"\n}"
